{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 01 · PROJECT HQ — what this is, and what it must never do",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## MISSION\nA local-first biometric attendance demonstrator a school can actually build.\n**Match on the sensor. Send only metadata. Survive an outage.**",
      "x": -620,
      "y": -640,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "f003",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "01 - Project HQ/Project HQ.md",
      "x": -620,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "g004",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "FOUR NON-NEGOTIABLES",
      "x": 120,
      "y": -1000,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**1 · Match on the sensor**\nOnly a slot number leaves the R307S. No image ever does.",
      "x": 150,
      "y": -930,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**2 · No biometric in the database**\nEvents carry uuid, slot, time, sync status — nothing else.",
      "x": 580,
      "y": -930,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**3 · Local isolated network only**\nNo cloud, no public exposure, no port forwarding.",
      "x": 150,
      "y": -750,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**4 · Synthetic data, consenting adults**\nNot now, not at the fair, not in a demo.",
      "x": 580,
      "y": -750,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "g009",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "SYSTEM SHAPE",
      "x": 120,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**EDGE — ESP32**\nR307S · OLED · DS3231 · LEDs · buzzer · LittleFS journal",
      "x": 150,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**LOCAL HOST — Python**\nFastAPI → SQLite (WAL) · dashboard planned",
      "x": 590,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Wi-Fi 2.4 GHz · isolated LAN**\nHTTP · plaintext · demo only",
      "x": 370,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g013",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "SCOPE — BUILT vs PLANNED",
      "x": -1100,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Firmware runtime** — BUILT — state machine, enrollment, journal, network client",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Backend API** — BUILT — health, students, enrollment, attendance ingest",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Database** — BUILT — schema v1, migrations, constraints, WAL",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Frontend** — NOT BUILT — `frontend/` is a design note",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**AI assistant** — DEFERRED by decision — must stay read-only",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "g019",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "CANONICAL DOCUMENTS",
      "x": 120,
